# Pairs with SagaCompletes. A delivered terminal is not recorded, so the
# broadcast keeps a target outstanding for ever.
MODULE: SagaCompletesFoldTerminalNotRecorded
TARGET: SagaCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the broadcast does not record the shards it visited, so the saga never completes
PERTURBS: SagaTerminal

--- FIND
    /\ told' = told \cup {s}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the visit is not recorded.
    /\ told' = told
--- END
